---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="隐私政策" titleEn="Privacy Policy">
  <div class="container page-hero"><div class="eyebrow" data-zh="隐私">Privacy</div><h1 data-zh="隐私政策">Privacy Policy</h1><p class="lead" data-zh="本政策说明 x-Reply-Helper 为提供账户、AI 回复草稿和充值服务而处理的信息。">This policy describes information processed by x-Reply-Helper to provide accounts, AI reply drafts, and credit purchases.</p></div>
  <article class="container legal">
    <h2 data-zh="我们处理的信息">Information we process</h2>
    <p data-zh="账户信息：注册邮箱、邮箱验证状态、账户与登录会话信息，以及用于扩展绑定的设备标识。邮箱用于账户验证、密码重置和必要的服务通知。">Account information: your registration email, verification status, account and session information, and the device identifier used to bind the extension. Email is used for verification, password reset, and necessary service messages.</p>
    <p data-zh="AI 回复草稿：当你主动请求生成时，扩展会将当前 X 帖子的文字和链接，以及你提供的回复风格、写作样本、风格统计和最近选择的回复（最多 20 条）发送到 x-Reply-Helper 后端；后端将生成所需内容发送至当前配置的第三方 AI 服务处理，生成三条候选回复。请勿提交你无权处理的敏感信息。">AI reply drafts: when you request generation, the extension sends the current X post text and link, along with your reply style, writing samples, style statistics, and up to 20 recently selected replies, to the x-Reply-Helper backend. The backend sends the content needed for generation to the configured third-party AI service to produce three reply candidates. Do not submit sensitive information you are not authorized to share.</p>
    <p data-zh="使用与本地数据：服务端记录生成请求所需的使用、额度和成本元数据。扩展在浏览器本地保存你的偏好设置、回复历史及最近选择，供后续使用。">Usage and local data: the service records usage, credit, and cost metadata needed to operate generation. The extension stores your preferences, reply history, and recent selections locally in your browser for later use.</p>
    <p data-zh="充值与交易：我们处理套餐、订单、支付渠道、金额、支付状态、平台交易标识、通知及额度账本记录，以确认付款并发放额度。支付服务商 MK99 参与支付订单处理和结果通知。">Purchases and transactions: we process package, order, payment channel, amount, payment status, provider transaction identifiers, notifications, and credit ledger records to confirm payment and grant credits. MK99 participates in payment order processing and payment notifications.</p>

    <h2 data-zh="服务供应商">Service providers</h2>
    <p data-zh="Cloudflare 提供网站、边缘 Worker、数据库基础设施与 Turnstile 注册安全验证；Resend 处理发送账户验证和密码重置邮件所需的收件邮箱与邮件内容；当前启用的 AI 服务处理帖子文字与链接、风格、写作样本及所选历史等生成所需内容；MK99 用于处理支付订单并向我们发送支付结果。各服务仅在提供相应功能所需的范围内接收信息。">Cloudflare provides website, edge Worker, database infrastructure, and Turnstile registration checks. Resend processes recipient email addresses and message content needed to send account verification and password reset emails. The selected AI service processes the post text and link, style, writing samples, and selected history needed to generate replies. MK99 processes payment orders and sends us payment results. Each provider receives information within the scope needed for its service.</p>

    <h2 data-zh="用途与限制">Use and limits</h2>
    <p data-zh="信息用于提供和维护回复草稿、账户与设备安全、额度和支付处理、反滥用、故障排查及用户支持。我们不出售用户数据，也不将其用于个性化广告。插件可按你的设置自动生成并填入 X 回复草稿；你可以编辑并自行决定是否发送，插件不会替你自动发布 X 内容。">Information is used to provide and maintain drafts, account and device security, credit and payment processing, abuse prevention, troubleshooting, and support. We do not sell user data or use it for personalized advertising. The extension can automatically generate and insert X reply drafts according to your settings. You can edit them and decide whether to send; the extension does not automatically publish X content.</p>

    <h2 data-zh="保留期限">Retention</h2>
    <p data-zh="生成结果用于安全重试的窗口约为 10 分钟，过期内容由定时清理任务删除。已完成请求的运行元数据按 30 天清理策略处理。扩展本地偏好和回复历史可由你在浏览器或扩展中清理；卸载扩展时，浏览器会按其扩展存储规则处理这些本地数据。">Generated results are available for a security retry window of about 10 minutes; expired content is removed by a scheduled cleanup task. Metadata for completed requests follows a 30-day cleanup policy. You can clear extension preferences and reply history in the browser or extension; when the extension is uninstalled, the browser handles its local extension storage under its storage rules.</p>
    <p data-zh="订单、支付、额度账本和必要的安全记录会在提供服务、处理争议及履行适用记录保存义务所需期间保留。我们不承诺这些记录适用统一的固定删除期限。">Orders, payment, credit ledger, and necessary security records are retained as needed to provide the service, handle disputes, and meet applicable record-keeping obligations. We do not promise one fixed deletion period for these records.</p>

    <h2 data-zh="数据访问、更正与删除请求">Data access, correction, and deletion requests</h2>
    <p data-zh="你可以请求访问、更正或删除个人数据。当前没有账户自助删除功能。我们会人工核查请求及相关记录；部分交易或安全记录可能需要继续保留。我们未承诺固定处理时限。">You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of personal data. There is currently no self-service account deletion feature. Requests and relevant records are reviewed manually; some transaction or security records may need to be retained. We do not promise a fixed response time.</p>
    <p data-zh="登录后可通过反馈页面提交数据请求；如果无法登录，也可直接发送邮件。请说明请求类型和关联账户邮箱；不要发送密码、验证码、API Key 或完整支付凭证。">You may submit a data request through the feedback page after signing in. If you cannot sign in, email us directly. Describe your request and the account email involved; do not send passwords, verification codes, API keys, or full payment credentials.</p>
    <p><a href="/feedback/" data-zh="登录后提交反馈或数据请求">Submit feedback or a data request after signing in</a></p>
    <p><strong data-zh="隐私与客服邮箱：">Privacy and support email: </strong><a href="mailto:zake6678@outlook.com">zake6678@outlook.com</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>
